cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TurnWave: end-of-turn detection for voice agents, trained from scratch"
message: "If you use this software or its models, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sukthe
    given-names: Nikhil
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nikhils-G/turnwave"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch end-of-turn detector for voice agents: a causal transformer over
  the transcript tail and a CNN over log-mel spectrograms, plus a fusion head. No
  pretrained weights, and the log-mel front end is hand-built on torch.stft.
  Evaluated on LiveKit's eot-bench, where it beats the VAD baseline on every
  reported metric at 4.8 ms CPU inference. The project also documents a
  generalization failure that in-domain metrics hid entirely, and the training-data
  change that fixed it.
keywords:
  - end-of-turn detection
  - turn-taking
  - voice agents
  - speech
  - onnx
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
